// 带内热源的稳态导热（原 heat_source 算例）：Γ = 20，Q = 10000，
// 左、右、下壁 T = 0，顶部绝热
{
  "mesh": { "polyMesh": "../../meshes/cavity/polyMesh" },
  "physics": { "field": "T", "diffusivity": 20, "source": 10000, "steady": true },
  "boundary": {
    "movingWall":  { "T": {"type": "zeroGradient"} },
    "leftWalls":   { "T": {"type": "fixedValue", "value": 0} },
    "rightWalls":  { "T": {"type": "fixedValue", "value": 0} },
    "bottomWalls": { "T": {"type": "fixedValue", "value": 0} }
  },
  "initial": { "T": 500 },
  "solution": { "T": {"solver": "PCG", "preconditioner": "GAMG"} },
  "run": { "maxIter": 20, "residualTol": 1e-10, "output": "output", "tecplot": true }
}
